              "newText": "6.1 Except as provided in Section 6.2, for a period of twelve (12) months from the Effective Date, the Company shall not participate in any project similar to the Site on the Internet with respect to Deerskin Products and HDI shall have the exclusive right to use of the \"Deerskin\" brand for a self-contained web site for the offering of Deerskin Products directly to the consumer on the Internet. This Section 6.1 shall terminate automatically if HDI fails to meet any service level or any delivery date under this Agreement."
